    "bg": "00002",
    "bgm": "000"
  },
  {
    "id": 7012001030010,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "はい、これもプロデューサーさまの、お陰です",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701200103/7012001030010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おいおい、そんな謙遜しなくていいんだ",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "これは、凛世の努力の成果だ",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7012001030020,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "はい……",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701200103/7012001030020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ダンスも、歌も、どんどん上達しているし……",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それ以上に、\r\n何かが変わってきたのかもしれないな",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7012001030030,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "何かが……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701200103/7012001030030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "凛世はまだ気づいていないかもしれないけど、\r\nきっと、少しずつ成長してるんだ",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺も応援している\r\nその意気で頑張ってくれ！",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7012001030040,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "はい……\r\nプロデューサーさまに、見ていただけるのでしたら……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701200103/7012001030040"
  },
  {
    "id": 7012001030050,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "凛世は、\r\n身が引き締まる、思いです……",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701200103/7012001030050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、よろしくな！　そうだ、第2審査にも通ったことだし\r\n俺に、何かしてほしいこととかはないか？",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7012001030060,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "いえ、そのような……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701200103/7012001030060"
  },
  {
    "id": 7012001030070,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "凛世は、ただ……",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701200103/7012001030070"
  },
  {
    "id": 7012001030080,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "プロデューサーさまの、お傍にいられれば\r\n十分で、ございます……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701200103/7012001030080"
  },
  {
    "id": 7012001030090,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "これからも、お傍で……\r\n精進してまいります",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701200103/7012001030090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そんなことでいいなら……",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7012001030100,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "はい……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
